# Graphify — knowledge graph outputs
# Commit: graph.json, GRAPH_REPORT.md, .graphify_python, .graphify_root, .graphify_labels.json
# (they let teammates query the graph and run --update without rebuilding from scratch)
graphify-out/graph.html
graphify-out/graph.svg
graphify-out/graph.graphml
graphify-out/cypher.txt
graphify-out/cost.json
graphify-out/obsidian/
graphify-out/wiki/
# Ephemeral extraction scratch files (always safe to delete)
